# Task: show the volume on-screen display after a change, with raise as the default.
# Program: this file.
# Run: execute docs/recipes/desktop-volume-osd.program
#      execute docs/recipes/desktop-volume-osd.program --input action=lower
# Test with fakes: the osd.volume applet is an injectable manifest. Run it with a fake
#   applet executable on the manifest path and check that the action value is passed through.
# Explain: the program prints nothing; the OSD is shown by the desktop shell.
# Replaces (Bash): the raise call of the desktop OSD helper script
accept action as text with default "raise"
run osd.volume with action action
